>The heroic method of fixing this is to carefully build up a character on the
>first few levels who can take on the Bad Guys.  Note that killing several
>demons with a low level character is a true test of Nethacking ability.
>
>The wimpy method is to have a character enter that level and then Quit.
>This will wipe out the bones level.
>
